    "sort": 1,
    "isComingSoon": false,
    "text": "<p><strong>WITH</strong> a strong sense of social responsibility for the physical spaces in which their structures inhabit, Hall Gad Architects are a new practice who specialize in ambitious and challenging architecture that aims to enhance and sustain environments and ecosystems alike. We worked with founders Jessica Hall and Holden Gad to create an identity and digital presence that matched their aesthetic sensibilities and sheer sense of scale and perspective.</p>",
