    "title": "AURA",
    "subtitle": "Naturally sourced products for mind, body and soul.",
    "slug": "aura",
    "sort": 2,
    "isComingSoon": false,
    "text": "<p><strong>AURA</strong> are a newly-founded beauty company that are as invested in mental health as much as physical, choosing to donate 10% of their profits to mental health charities across America from their pop-up stores. It&rsquo;s been our pleasure to work with them on their ident and launch rollout, handling everything from sun-care packaging to social campaigns, with a comprehensive e-commerce website spearheading a digital phase coming later in the year.</p>",
